---
description: Permanent engineering rules for MyVista LLM Fabric
alwaysApply: true
---

This workspace is the MyVista LLM Fabric repository
(https://github.com/officialanubhavbhatia/llm-fabric).

Authorship: all production code is authored under Anubhav Bhatia. Never add AI or
Cursor authorship, co-author trailers, or generated-by markers.

Honesty: never fabricate benchmarks, test results, metrics, or implemented
capabilities. If it was not measured, do not state it. If it is not built, say so.

Scope: all code for this project goes in this repo. Do not clone, copy, or modify
any other project.

Specification: the project engineering constitution (docs/constitution.md, once
committed) is the permanent architecture and engineering specification and
overrides inference. Keep ARCHITECTURE.md consistent with it.

Sequencing: do not implement phases ahead of the specification. Inspect first,
confirm the plan, then build only the current phase.
